**12. Show the frequency of missing data points for each quarter by room.**

```{r}

# Showing frequency of missing data point for each quarter by room.

johnson_ela_final %>%
  group_by(Room, Quarter) %>%
  summarise(Missing_Count = sum(is.na(Rating)), .groups = "drop") %>%
