**13. Construct a graph that facets by room and illustrates the median rating trends across the four quarters for each of the fifth-grade classes.**

```{r}

# Graphing facets by room across four quarters for each fifth grade classes.

johnson_ela_final %>%
  group_by(Room, Quarter) %>%
  summarise(Median_Rating = median(Rating, na.rm = TRUE), .groups = "drop") %>%
  ggplot(aes(x = Quarter, y = Median_Rating, group = Room)) +
  geom_line(color = "steelblue", size = 1) +
  geom_point(color = "steelblue", size = 2) +
  facet_wrap(~ Room) +
  labs(
    title = "Median Rating Trends Across Quarters by Room",
    x = "Quarter",
    y = "Median Rating"
  ) +
  theme_minimal()

```


